{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122988","id":4394455180,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBe4QjA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122988","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122988.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122988.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122988","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122988/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122988/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122988/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/66aa2ac193ad505d973d7f394001cc38b2b34427","number":122988,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix CPUParticles2d ALIGN_Y_WITH_VELOCITY flag","user":{"login":"Haizlbliek","id":152229273,"node_id":"U_kgDOCRLVmQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152229273?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haizlbliek","html_url":"https://github.com/Haizlbliek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haizlbliek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haizlbliek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haizlbliek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haizlbliek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haizlbliek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haizlbliek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haizlbliek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haizlbliek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haizlbliek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- If the `Align Y` flag is enabled, all `Angle` settings are ignored.\r\n- Orbit velocity is not accounted for during `Align Y` calculations.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nMany times I (and others I have talked with) have been annoyed by the `Align Y` flag forcing one specific angle. I made this small PR to fix that issue, along with a similar issue with orbit velocity.\r\n\r\nI was thinking of splitting this into two PRs, but I felt like they were closely enough related that splitting them would be unhelpful.\r\n\r\n### Additional Work\r\n\r\n- The new variable on line 899 could probably be moved somewhere else or perhaps somehow removed.\r\n- If the particles have orbit velocity, the first frame a particle spawns the orbit is not calculated and thus, flashes the angle for one frame.\r\n- The orbit velocity angle calculations could be simplified to use more direct math rather than calculating the difference in positions. This would also fix the above issue.\r\n- The bottom two modified lines could be wrapped in an if statement to skip performing unnecessary math.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.